<p>"Expects to earn at least 18 percent" gives the discount rate. "Fund if the decision were based only on financial information" means we compare the projects using <strong>NPV</strong> (and can back it up with IRR and payback). The chart in the book gives inflow and outflow for each year, so first compute <strong>net flow = inflow − outflow</strong> (the book has already done this).</p>
