<aside class="callout trap"><p class="ct">Common mistakes</p><ul><li>Adding profit to direct cost instead of to total cost.</li><li>Treating the apportion percentages as percentages of the parent box (check they add to 100 across the whole tree).</li><li>Forgetting to subtract the earlier units for a follow-on order.</li><li>Charging R&amp;D twice.</li><li>Not rounding people up to whole numbers.</li></ul></aside>
