<section id="ch6-questions" class="section-block"><h3 style="margin-top:50px">Practice questions: worked solutions</h3><p class="mini">Ordered by type. Do the drawing questions first, then the calculations, then the Gantt charts, then the lag questions.</p><section class="qgroup"><h3>Type 1: Drawing the network (burst and merge)</h3><p><b>How to recognise it:</b> a table of activities and predecessors and no times. <b>Method:</b> one box per activity, one arrow per predecessor. A burst activity has several followers; a merge activity has several predecessors.</p><article class="q" id="c6q1" data-q="c6q1">
