<p>Each row tells you one activity, how long it takes, and what must be finished before it can start. Activities with "None" are <b>starting activities</b>; an activity that no one else waits for is an <b>ending activity</b>.</p>
<ul><li>Burst activities (more than one follower): <b>B</b> (followed by C, D).</li><li>Merge activities (more than one predecessor): <b>E</b> (waits for C, D).</li></ul><p>Draw one box per activity and an arrow from each predecessor. Left to right, like this:</p><figure class="fig"><svg class="chart net" viewBox="0 0 790 152" style="min-width:553px" role="img" aria-label="Step 1: the network drawn from the table (no times yet)" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><defs><marker id="ar9" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="#6B7A8B"/></marker><marker id="arc9" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="#B3261E"/></marker></defs><path class="e" d="M170.0 76.0 C200.0 76.0 190.0 76.0 220.0 76.0" marker-end="url(#ar9)"/><path class="e" d="M370.0 76.0 C400.0 76.0 390.0 43.0 420.0 43.0" marker-end="url(#ar9)"/><path class="e" d="M370.0 76.0 C400.0 76.0 390.0 109.0 420.0 109.0" marker-end="url(#ar9)"/><path class="e" d="M570.0 43.0 C600.0 43.0 590.0 76.0 620.0 76.0" marker-end="url(#ar9)"/><path class="e" d="M570.0 109.0 C600.0 109.0 590.0 76.0 620.0 76.0" marker-end="url(#ar9)"/><g class="nd"><rect x="20" y="53.0" width="150" height="46" rx="6"/><text class="id" x="32" y="72.0">A</text><text class="nm2" x="32" y="89.0">Survey site</text></g><g class="nd"><rect x="220" y="53.0" width="150" height="46" rx="6"/><text class="id" x="232" y="72.0">B</text><text class="nm2" x="232" y="89.0">Excavate site</text></g><g class="nd"><rect x="420" y="20.0" width="150" height="46" rx="6"/><text class="id" x="432" y="39.0">C</text><text class="nm2" x="432" y="56.0">Install power lines</text></g><g class="nd"><rect x="420" y="86.0" width="150" height="46" rx="6"/><text class="id" x="432" y="105.0">D</text><text class="nm2" x="432" y="122.0">Install drainage</text></g><g class="nd"><rect x="620" y="53.0" width="150" height="46" rx="6"/><text class="id" x="632" y="72.0">E</text><text class="nm2" x="632" y="89.0">Pour foundation</text></g></svg><figcaption>Step 1: the network drawn from the table (no times yet)</figcaption></figure><h5>Step 2. Forward pass (earliest start and earliest finish)</h5><p>Start at zero. ES = the largest EF of the predecessors (only the last predecessor to finish matters), EF = ES + duration.</p><ul><li><b>A</b>: nothing comes before it, so ES = 0 and EF = 0 + 2 = <b>2</b>.</li><li><b>B</b>: comes after A (EF = 2), so ES = 2 and EF = 2 + 4 = <b>6</b>.</li><li><b>C</b>: comes after B (EF = 6), so ES = 6 and EF = 6 + 3 = <b>9</b>.</li><li><b>D</b>: comes after B (EF = 6), so ES = 6 and EF = 6 + 5 = <b>11</b>.</li><li><b>E</b> is a merge activity: it waits for C (EF = 9), D (EF = 11). ES = the <i>largest</i> = 11, EF = 11 + 3 = <b>14</b>.</li></ul><h5>Step 3. Backward pass (latest start and latest finish)</h5><p>Start at the end with LF = the project length. LS = LF − duration. For a burst activity use the smallest LS of its followers.</p><ul><li><b>E</b>: last activity, so LF = project length = 14. LS = 14 − 3 = <b>11</b>.</li><li><b>D</b>: only E follows it (LS = 11), so LF = 11. LS = 11 − 5 = <b>6</b>.</li><li><b>C</b>: only E follows it (LS = 11), so LF = 11. LS = 11 − 3 = <b>8</b>.</li><li><b>B</b> is a burst activity: C (LS = 8), D (LS = 6) follow it. LF = the <i>smallest</i> = 6. LS = 6 − 4 = <b>2</b>.</li><li><b>A</b>: only B follows it (LS = 2), so LF = 2. LS = 2 − 2 = <b>0</b>.</li></ul><h5>Step 4. Slack, critical path and the completed network</h5><p>Total slack = LS − ES. Slack 0 means critical. Free slack = the smallest ES of the followers minus this activity's EF.</p><div class="tablewrap"><table class="calc"><thead><tr><th class="c">ID</th><th class="l">Activity</th><th class="r">Dur</th><th class="r">ES</th><th class="r">EF</th><th class="r">LS</th><th class="r">LF</th><th class="r">Total slack</th><th class="r">Free slack</th><th class="l"></th></tr></thea