<h4>Print Software: color printer drivers</h4>
<div class="restate"><p>K. Nelson, project manager of Print Software, Inc., wants you to prepare a project network; compute the early, late and slack activity times; determine the planned project duration; and identify the critical path.</p><div class="tablewrap"><table class="calc"><thead><tr><th class="c">ID</th><th class="l">Description</th><th class="l">Predecessor(s)</th><th class="r">Time (days)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="c">A</td><td class="l">External specifications</td><td class="l">None</td><td class="r">8</td></tr><tr><td class="c">B</td><td class="l">Review design features</td><td class="l">A</td><td class="r">2</td></tr><tr><td class="c">C</td><td class="l">Document new features</td><td class="l">A</td><td class="r">3</td></tr><tr><td class="c">D</td><td class="l">Write software</td><td class="l">A</td><td class="r">60</td></tr><tr><td class="c">E</td><td class="l">Program and test</td><td class="l">B</td><td class="r">40</td></tr><tr><td class="c">F</td><td class="l">Edit and publish notes</td><td class="l">C</td><td class="r">2</td></tr><tr><td class="c">G</td><td class="l">Review manual</td><td class="l">D</td><td class="r">2</td></tr><tr><td class="c">H</td><td class="l">Alpha site</td><td class="l">E, F</td><td class="r">20</td></tr><tr><td class="c">I</td><td class="l">Print manual</td><td class="l">G</td><td class="r">10</td></tr><tr><td class="c">J</td><td class="l">Beta site</td><td class="l">H, I</td><td class="r">10</td></tr><tr><td class="c">K</td><td class="l">Manufacture</td><td class="l">J</td><td class="r">12</td></tr><tr><td class="c">L</td><td class="l">Release and ship</td><td class="l">K</td><td class="r">3</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<details class="answer"><summary>Show the solution and the teaching</summary><div class="sol"><h5>Forward pass</h5><ul><li><b>A</b>: nothing comes before it, so ES = 0 and EF = 0 + 8 = <b>8</b>.</li><li><b>B</b>: comes after A (EF = 8), so ES = 8 and EF = 8 + 2 = <b>10</b>.</li><li><b>C</b>: comes after A (EF = 8), so ES = 8 and EF = 8 + 3 = <b>11</b>.</li><li><b>D</b>: comes after A (EF = 8), so ES = 8 and EF = 8 + 60 = <b>68</b>.</li><li><b>E</b>: comes after B (EF = 10), so ES = 10 and EF = 10 + 40 = <b>50</b>.</li><li><b>F</b>: comes after C (EF = 11), so ES = 11 and EF = 11 + 2 = <b>13</b>.</li><li><b>G</b>: comes after D (EF = 68), so ES = 68 and EF = 68 + 2 = <b>70</b>.</li><li><b>H</b> is a merge activity: it waits for E (EF = 50), F (EF = 13). ES = the <i>largest</i> = 50, EF = 50 + 20 = <b>70</b>.</li><li><b>I</b>: comes after G (EF = 70), so ES = 70 and EF = 70 + 10 = <b>80</b>.</li><li><b>J</b> is a merge activity: it waits for H (EF = 70), I (EF = 80). ES = the <i>largest</i> = 80, EF = 80 + 10 = <b>90</b>.</li><li><b>K</b>: comes after J (EF = 90), so ES = 90 and EF = 90 + 12 = <b>102</b>.</li><li><b>L</b>: comes after K (EF = 102), so ES = 102 and EF = 102 + 3 = <b>105</b>.</li></ul><h5>Backward pass</h5><ul><li><b>L</b>: last activity, so LF = project length = 105. LS = 105 − 3 = <b>102</b>.</li><li><b>K</b>: only L follows it (LS = 102), so LF = 102. LS = 102 − 12 = <b>90</b>.</li><li><b>J</b>: only K follows it (LS = 90), so LF = 90. LS = 90 − 10 = <b>80</b>.</li><li><b>I</b>: only J follows it (LS = 80), so LF = 80. LS = 80 − 10 = <b>70</b>.</li><li><b>H</b>: only J follows it (LS = 80), so LF = 80. LS = 80 − 20 = <b>60</b>.</li><li><b>G</b>: only I follows it (LS = 70), so LF = 70. LS = 70 − 2 = <b>68</b>.</li><li><b>F</b>: only H follows it (LS = 60), so LF = 60. LS = 60 − 2 = <b>58</b>.</li><li><b>E</b>: only H follows it (LS = 60), so LF = 60. LS = 60 − 40 = <b>20</b>.</li><li><b>D</b>: only G follows it (LS = 68), so LF = 68. LS = 68 − 60 = <b>8</b>.</li><li><b>C</b>: only F follows it (LS = 58), so LF = 58. LS = 58 − 3 = <b>55</b>.</li><li><b>B</b>: only E follows it (LS = 20), so LF = 20. LS = 20 − 2 = <b>18</b>.</li><li><b>A</b> is a burst activity: B (LS = 18), C (LS = 55), D (LS = 8) follow it. LF = the <i>smallest</i> = 8. LS = 8 − 8 = <b>0</b>.</li></ul><h5>Slack, critical path and the completed network</h5><div class="tablewrap"><table class="calc"><thead><tr><th class="c">ID</th><th class="l">Activity</th><th class="r">Dur</th><th class="r">ES</th><th class="r">EF</th><th class="r">LS</th><th class="r">LF</th><th class="r">Total slack</th><th class="r">Free slack</th><th class="l"></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="hl"><td class="c">A</td><td class="l">External specifications</td><td class="r">8</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="r">8</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="r">8</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="l">Critical</td></tr><tr><td class="c">B</td><td class="l">Review design features</td><td class="r">2</td><td class="r">8</td><td class="r">10</td><td class="r">18</td><td class="r">20</td><td class="r">10</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="l"></td></tr><tr><td class="c">C</td><td class="l">Document new features</td><td class="r">3</td><td class="r">8</td><td class="r">11</td><td class="r">55</td><td class="r">58</td><td class="r">47</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="l"></td></tr><tr class="hl"><td class="c">D</td><td class="l">Write software</td><td class="r">60</td><td class="r">8</td><td class="r">68</td><td class="r">8</td><td class="r">68</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="l">Critical</td></tr><tr><td class="c">E</td><td class="l">Program and test</td><td class="r">40</td><td class="r">10</td><td class="r">50</td><td class="r">20</td><td class="r">60</td><td class="r">10</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="l"></td></tr><tr><td class="c">F</td><td class="l">Edit and publish notes</td><td class="r">2</td><td class="r">11</td><td class="r">13</td><