.0" width="132" height="68" rx="5"/><line x1="590" x2="722" y1="136.7" y2="136.7"/><line x1="590" x2="722" y1="159.3" y2="159.3"/><line x1="624" x2="624" y1="114.0" y2="182.0"/><line x1="688" x2="688" y1="114.0" y2="182.0"/><text class="n" x="607.0" y="129.3" text-anchor="middle">24</text><text class="id" x="656.0" y="129.3" text-anchor="middle">E</text><text class="n" x="705.0" y="129.3" text-anchor="middle">29</text><text class="sl" x="607.0" y="152.0" text-anchor="middle">1</text><text class="nm" x="656.0" y="152.0" text-anchor="middle">Test</text><text class="sl" x="705.0" y="152.0" text-anchor="middle">1</text><text class="n" x="607.0" y="174.7" text-anchor="middle">25</text><text class="du" x="656.0" y="174.7" text-anchor="middle">5</text><text class="n" x="705.0" y="174.7" text-anchor="middle">30</text></g><g class="nd crit"><rect x="780" y="67.0" width="132" height="68" rx="5"/><line x1="780" x2="912" y1="89.7" y2="89.7"/><line x1="780" x2="912" y1="112.3" y2="112.3"/><line x1="814" x2="814" y1="67.0" y2="135.0"/><line x1="878" x2="878" y1="67.0" y2="135.0"/><text class="n" x="797.0" y="82.3" text-anchor="middle">33</text><text class="id" x="846.0" y="82.3" text-anchor="middle">F</text><text class="n" x="895.0" y="82.3" text-anchor="middle">43</text><text class="sl" x="797.0" y="105.0" text-anchor="middle">0</text><text class="nm" x="846.0" y="105.0" text-anchor="middle">Field test</text><text class="sl" x="895.0" y="105.0" text-anchor="middle">0</text><text class="n" x="797.0" y="127.7" text-anchor="middle">33</text><text class="du" x="846.0" y="127.7" text-anchor="middle">10</text><text class="n" x="895.0" y="127.7" text-anchor="middle">43</text></g></svg><p class="mini" style="margin:6px 8px 2px">Each box: <b>top row</b> ES | ID | EF, <b>middle row</b> start slack | activity | finish slack, <b>bottom row</b> LS | duration | LF. Red boxes and red arrows are the critical path.</p><figcaption>Completed network: orange arrows carry a lag or lead, red arrows are the critical links</figcaption></figure><div class="final"><p class="ct">Final answer</p><p>Project duration = <b>43 days</b>.</p><p>Critical path: <b>A →[FF+3] B → C →[FS+5] D → F</b>.</p><p>Critical for only the start or only the finish: <b>B</b> (finish only).</p></div><div class="diff"><b>What is different here:</b> B is where the lags bite. The start limit gives ES = 10, but the finish limit gives EF = 15 + 3 = 18, not 10 + 5 = 15. So B's <b>finish</b> is critical (finish slack 0) while its start has 3 days of slack. This matches the professor's answer: <b>A → B (finish only) → C → D → F</b>.</div></div></details>
