<h4>Design, order parts, code, debug, assemble, install</h4>
<div class="restate"><p>From the information in the network (A Design 5, B Order Parts 1, C Code Software 6, D Assemble 3, E Debug 3, F Install 1, with the lags shown), compute the early, late and slack times for each activity. Identify the critical path.</p></div>
<details class="answer"><summary>Show the solution and the teaching</summary><div class="sol"><h5>Step 1. How to read a lag network</h5>
<p>Every arrow has a type and a lag. Put each one in words first: <b>FS+3</b> means "start 3 after the predecessor finishes"; <b>SS+2</b> means "start 2 after the predecessor starts"; <b>FF+2</b> means "finish 2 after the predecessor finishes"; a minus sign is a lead. In the book's pictures an arrow leaves the <i>right</i> side of a box for a finish relation and the <i>left</i> side for a start relation, and enters the <i>left</i> side of the next box for a start limit and the <i>right</i> side for a finish limit.</p>
<p><b>Forward pass rule:</b> start limits (FS, SS) fix the <b>ES</b>; finish limits (FF, SF) can push the <b>EF</b> later than ES + duration. Take the largest limit each time. <b>Backward pass rule:</b> the mirror image, taking the smallest.</p><p><b>Reading your book's picture:</b> A to C is a plain arrow. A to B leaves the start of A and carries "Lag 4" (SS+4). B to D carries "Lag 3" (FS+3, a delivery wait). C to E has two arrows, both "Lag 2": one start to start and one finish to finish. D and E both feed F.</p><h5>The relationships</h5><div class="tablewrap"><table class="calc"><thead><tr><th class="c">ID</th><th class="l">Description</th><th class="l">Predecessor(s)</th><th class="r">Time (days)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="c">A</td><td class="l">Design</td><td class="l">None</td><td class="r">5</td></tr><tr><td class="c">B</td><td class="l">Order parts</td><td class="l">A (SS+4)</td><td class="r">1</td></tr><tr><td class="c">C</td><td class="l">Code software</td><td class="l">A</td><td class="r">6</td></tr><tr><td class="c">D</td><td class="l">Assemble</td><td class="l">B (FS+3)</td><td class="r">3</td></tr><tr><td class="c">E</td><td class="l">Debug</td><td class="l">C (SS+2), C (FF+2)</td><td class="r">3</td></tr><tr><td class="c">F</td><td class="l">Install</td><td class="l">D, E</td><td class="r">1</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h5>Forward pass</h5><ul><li><b>A</b>: nothing comes before it, so ES = 0 and EF = 0 + 5 = <b>5</b>.</li><li><b>B</b> (A SS+4: ES 0+4 = 4 (start)). ES = 4. EF = the larger of ES + duration = 4 + 1 = 5 = <b>5</b>.</li><li><b>C</b> (A FS: EF 5 = 5 (start)). ES = 5. EF = the larger of ES + duration = 5 + 6 = 11 = <b>11</b>.</li><li><b>D</b> (B FS+3: EF 5+3 = 8 (start)). ES = 8. EF = the larger of ES + duration = 8 + 3 = 11 = <b>11</b>.</li><li><b>E</b> (C SS+2: ES 5+2 = 7 (start); C FF+2: EF 11+2 = 13 (finish)). ES = 7. EF = the larger of ES + duration = 7 + 3 = 10 and the finish limit 13 = <b>13</b>.</li><li><b>F</b> (D FS: EF 11 = 11 (start); E FS: EF 13 = 13 (start)). ES = 13 (largest start limit). EF = the larger of ES + duration = 13 + 1 = 14 = <b>14</b>.</li></ul><h5>Backward pass</h5><ul><li><b>F</b>: last activity, so LF = project length = 14. LS = 14 − 1 = <b>13</b>.</li><li><b>E</b> (F FS+0: LS 13+0 = 13 (finish limit)). LF = <b>13</b>, LS = <b>10</b>.</li><li><b>D</b> (F FS+0: LS 13+0 = 13 (finish limit)). LF = <b>13</b>, LS = <b>10</b>.</li><li><b>C</b> (E SS+2: LS 10-2 = 8 (start limit); E FF+2: LF 13-2 = 11 (finish limit)). LF = <b>11</b>, LS = <b>5</b>.</li><li><b>B</b> (D FS+3: LS 10-3 = 7 (finish limit)). LF = <b>7</b>, LS = <b>6</b>.</li><li><b>A</b> (B SS+4: LS 6-4 = 2 (start limit); C FS+0: LS 5+0 = 5 (finish limit)). LF = <b>5</b>, LS = <b>0</b>.</li></ul><h5>Start slack, finish slack and the completed network</h5><p>Start slack = LS − ES. Finish slack = LF − EF. An activity is critical if either is zero.</p><div class="tablewrap"><table class="calc"><thead><tr><th class="c">ID</th><th class="l">Activity</th><th class="r">Dur</th><th class="r">ES</th><th class="r">EF</th><th class="r">LS</th><th class="r">LF</th><th class="r">Start slack</th><th class="r">Finish slack</th><th class="l"></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="hl"><td class="c">A</td><td class="l">Design</td><td class="r">5</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="r">5</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="r">5</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="l">Critical</td></tr><tr><td class="c">B</td><td class="l">Order parts</td><td class="r">1</td><td class="r">4</td><td class="r">5</td><td class="r">6</td><td class="r">7</td><td class="r">2</td><td class="r">2</td><td class="l"></td></tr><tr class="hl"><td class="c">C</td><td class="l">Code software</td><td class="r">6</td><td class="r">5</td><td class="r">11</td><td class="r">5</td><td class="r">11</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="l">Critical</td></tr><tr><td class="c">D</td><td class="l">Assemble</td><td class="r">3</td><td class="r">8</td><td class="r">11</td><td class="r">10</td><td class="r">13</td><td class="r">2</td><td class="r">2</td><td class="l"></td></tr><tr class="hl"><td class="c">E</td><td class="l">Debug</td><td class="r">3</td><td class="r">7</td><td class="r">13</td><td class="r">10</td><td class="r">13</td><td class="r">3</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="l">Critical</td></tr><tr class="hl"><td class="c">F</td><td class="l">Install</td><td class="r">1</td><td class="r">13</td><td class="r">14</td><td class="r">13</td><td class="r">14</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="l">Critical</td></tr></tbody></table></div><figure class="fig"><svg class="chart net" viewBox="0 0 742 202" style="min-width:534px" role="img" aria-label="Completed network: orange arrows carry a lag or lead, red arrows are the critical links" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><defs><marker id="ar29" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="#6B7A8B"/></marker><marker id="arc29" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="#B3261E"/></marker></defs><path class="e lag" d="M20.0 101.0 C-10.0 101.0 180.0 54.0 210.0 54.0" marker-end="url(#ar29)"/><rect class="lagbg" x="-23.0" y="68.5" width="38" height="16" rx="4"/><text class="lagt" x="-4.0" y="81.5" text-anchor="middle">SS+4</text><path class="e crit" d="M152.0 101.0 C182.0 101.0 180.0 148.0 210.0 148.0" marker-end="url(#arc29)"/><path class="e lag" d="M342.0 54.0 C372.0 54.0 370.0 54.0 400.0 54.0" marker-end="url(#ar29)"/><rect class="lagbg" x="352.0" y="45.0" width="38" height="16" rx="4"/><text class="lagt" x="371.0" y="58.0" text-anchor="middle">FS+3</text><path class="e crit" d="M210.0 148.0 C180.0 148.0 370.0 148.0 400.0 148.0" marker-end="url(#arc29)"/><rect class="lagbg" x="167.0" y="139.0" width="38" height="16" rx="4"/><text class="lagt" x="186.0" y="152.0" text-anchor="middle">