<h4>CyClon: adding three finish-to-start lags</h4>
<div class="restate"><p>Part B. The team recognises three finish-to-start lags. Procure prototype parts involves only 2 days of work but takes 8 days for the parts to be delivered. Order stock components: 2 days of work and 8 days of delivery. Order custom components: 2 days of work and 13 days of delivery. Reconfigure the schedule by entering the three FS lags. What impact did these lags have on the original schedule? On the amount of work required to complete the project?</p></div>
<details class="answer"><summary>Show the solution and the teaching</summary><div class="sol"><h5>The relationships</h5><div class="tablewrap"><table class="calc"><thead><tr><th class="c">ID</th><th class="l">Description</th><th class="l">Predecessor(s)</th><th class="r">Time (days)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="c">2</td><td class="l">Design</td><td class="l">None</td><td class="r">10</td></tr><tr><td class="c">3</td><td class="l">Procure prototype parts</td><td class="l">2</td><td class="r">2</td></tr><tr><td class="c">4</td><td class="l">Fabricate parts</td><td class="l">2</td><td class="r">8</td></tr><tr><td class="c">5</td><td class="l">Assemble prototype</td><td class="l">3 (FS+8), 4</td><td class="r">4</td></tr><tr><td class="c">6</td><td class="l">Laboratory test</td><td class="l">5</td><td class="r">7</td></tr><tr><td class="c">7</td><td class="l">Field test</td><td class="l">6</td><td class="r">10</td></tr><tr><td class="c">8</td><td class="l">Adjust design</td><td class="l">7</td><td class="r">6</td></tr><tr><td class="c">9</td><td class="l">Order stock components</td><td class="l">8</td><td class="r">2</td></tr><tr><td class="c">10</td><td class="l">Order custom components</td><td class="l">8</td><td class="r">2</td></tr><tr><td class="c">11</td><td class="l">Assemble test production unit</td><td class="l">9 (FS+8), 10 (FS+13)</td><td class="r">10</td></tr><tr><td class="c">12</td><td class="l">Test unit</td><td class="l">11</td><td class="r">5</td></tr><tr><td class="c">13</td><td class="l">Document results</td><td class="l">12</td><td class="r">3</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h5>Forward pass</h5><ul><li><b>2</b>: nothing comes before it, so ES = 0 and EF = 0 + 10 = <b>10</b>.</li><li><b>3</b> (2 FS: EF 10 = 10 (start)). ES = 10. EF = the larger of ES + duration = 10 + 2 = 12 = <b>12</b>.</li><li><b>4</b> (2 FS: EF 10 = 10 (start)). ES = 10. EF = the larger of ES + duration = 10 + 8 = 18 = <b>18</b>.</li><li><b>5</b> (3 FS+8: EF 12+8 = 20 (start); 4 FS: EF 18 = 18 (start)). ES = 20 (largest start limit). EF = the larger of ES + duration = 20 + 4 = 24 = <b>24</b>.</li><li><b>6</b> (5 FS: EF 24 = 24 (start)). ES = 24. EF = the larger of ES + duration = 24 + 7 = 31 = <b>31</b>.</li><li><b>7</b> (6 FS: EF 31 = 31 (start)). ES = 31. EF = the larger of ES + duration = 31 + 10 = 41 = <b>41</b>.</li><li><b>8</b> (7 FS: EF 41 = 41 (start)). ES = 41. EF = the larger of ES + duration = 41 + 6 = 47 = <b>47</b>.</li><li><b>9</b> (8 FS: EF 47 = 47 (start)). ES = 47. EF = the larger of ES + duration = 47 + 2 = 49 = <b>49</b>.</li><li><b>10</b> (8 FS: EF 47 = 47 (start)). ES = 47. EF = the larger of ES + duration = 47 + 2 = 49 = <b>49</b>.</li><li><b>11</b> (9 FS+8: EF 49+8 = 57 (start); 10 FS+13: EF 49+13 = 62 (start)). ES = 62 (largest start limit). EF = the larger of ES + duration = 62 + 10 = 72 = <b>72</b>.</li><li><b>12</b> (11 FS: EF 72 = 72 (start)). ES = 72. EF = the larger of ES + duration = 72 + 5 = 77 = <b>77</b>.</li><li><b>13</b> (12 FS: EF 77 = 77 (start)). ES = 77. EF = the larger of ES + duration = 77 + 3 = 80 = <b>80</b>.</li></ul><h5>Backward pass</h5><ul><li><b>13</b>: last activity, so LF = project length = 80. LS = 80 − 3 = <b>77</b>.</li><li><b>12</b> (13 FS+0: LS 77+0 = 77 (finish limit)). LF = <b>77</b>, LS = <b>72</b>.</li><li><b>11</b> (12 FS+0: LS 72+0 = 72 (finish limit)). LF = <b>72</b>, LS = <b>62</b>.</li><li><b>10</b> (11 FS+13: LS 62-13 = 49 (finish limit)). LF = <b>49</b>, LS = <b>47</b>.</li><li><b>9</b> (11 FS+8: LS 62-8 = 54 (finish limit)). LF = <b>54</b>, LS = <b>52</b>.</li><li><b>8</b> (9 FS+0: LS 52+0 = 52 (finish limit); 10 FS+0: LS 47+0 = 47 (finish limit)). LF = <b>47</b>, LS = <b>41</b>.</li><li><b>7</b> (8 FS+0: LS 41+0 = 41 (finish limit)). LF = <b>41</b>, LS = <b>31</b>.</li><li><b>6</b> (7 FS+0: LS 31+0 = 31 (finish limit)). LF = <b>31</b>, LS = <b>24</b>.</li><li><b>5</b> (6 FS+0: LS 24+0 = 24 (finish limit)). LF = <b>24</b>, LS = <b>20</b>.</li><li><b>4</b> (5 FS+0: LS 20+0 = 20 (finish limit)). LF = <b>20</b>, LS = <b>12</b>.</li><li><b>3</b> (5 FS+8: LS 20-8 = 12 (finish limit)). LF = <b>12</b>, LS = <b>10</b>.</li><li><b>2</b> (3 FS+0: LS 10+0 = 10 (finish limit); 4 FS+0: LS 12+0 = 12 (finish limit)). LF = <b>10</b>, LS = <b>0</b>.</li></ul><h5>Start slack, finish slack and the completed network</h5><p>Start slack = LS − ES. Finish slack = LF − EF. An activity is critical if either is zero.</p><div class="tablewrap"><table class="calc"><thead><tr><th class="c">ID</th><th class="l">Activity</th><th class="r">Dur</th><th class="r">ES</th><th class="r">EF</th><th class="r">LS</th><th class="r">LF</th><th class="r">Start slack</th><th class="r">Finish slack</th><th class="l"></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="hl"><td class="c">2</td><td class="l">Design</td><td class="r">10</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="r">10</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="r">10</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="l">Critical</td></tr><tr class="hl"><td class="c">3</td><td class="l">Procure prototype parts</td><td class="r">2</td><td class="r">10</td><td class="r">12</td><td class="r">10</td><td class="r">12</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="l">Critical</td></tr><tr><td class="c">4</td><td class="l">Fabricate parts</td><td class="r">8</td><td class="r">10</td><td class="r">18</td><td class="r">12</td><td class="r">20</td><td class="r">2</td><td class="r">2</td><td class="l"></td></tr><tr class="hl"><td class="c">5</td><td class="l">Assemble prototype</td><td class="r">4</td><td class="r">20</td><td class="r">24</td><td class="r">20</td><td class="r">24</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="l">Critical</td></tr><tr class="hl"><td class="c">6</td><td class="l">Laboratory test</td><td class="r">7</td><td class="r">24</td><td class="r">31</td><td class="r">24</td><td class="r">31</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="l">Critical</td></tr><tr class="hl"><td class="c">7</td><td class="l"