<p>T<sub>E</sub> = <b>86</b>. Critical activities: 1, 2, 5, 6, 7.</p>
<h5>Step 4. Variance of the critical path</h5>
<p>Add the variances of activities 1, 2, 5, 6, 7: 9 + 4 + 25 + 1 + 1 = <b>40</b>. σ<sub>TE</sub> = √40 = <b>6.32</b>.</p>
<h5>Step 5. Z and the probability</h5>
<p>Z = (93 − 86) ÷ 6.32 = 7 ÷ 6.32 = <b>1.11</b>. From the table: +1.0 → 0.841 and +1.2 → 0.885, so Z = 1.11 gives about <b>0.86</b> (exact normal curve: 0.87).</p>
<div class="final"><p class="ct">Final answer</p><p>The probability of completing the National Holiday Toy project in 93 time units is about <b>86%</b> (0.86 from the table).</p></div>
