<h5>Part 4. Probability of completing by day 112 and by day 116</h5>
<p>Variance of the critical path: activities 1, 5, 7, 8, 12, 14 = 4 + 25 + 1 + 9 + 9 + 1 = <b>49</b>, so σ = √49 = <b>7</b>.</p>
