ore Q (weeks 12-18)</figcaption></figure>
<div class="final"><p class="ct">Final answer</p><p><b>Critical chain: S → T → Q → R → Z, 24 weeks.</b> With the 8-week project buffer the latest promised date is 24 + 8 = <b>32 weeks</b>, but the plan is to finish at 24 weeks and only use the buffer if things go wrong. This is what your slide means by <b>"Project duration = (24 + buffer consumption) weeks"</b>.</p></div>
