<section id="ch9-questions" class="section-block"><h3 style="margin-top:50px">Practice questions: worked solutions</h3><p class="mini">Every move is explained in the same way. The first question also lists the plan for the whole method.</p><section class="qgroup"><h3>Type 1: Crash to the crash point (no indirect costs)</h3><p><b>How to recognise it:</b> 'compress one time unit per move using the least-cost method'. <b>Method:</b> critical path, cheapest activity, update cost, repeat.</p><article class="q" id="c9q1" data-q="c9q1">
