<tr><td>CPI = EV ÷ AC = 160 ÷ 230</td><td class="r">0.70</td></tr>
<tr><td>Estimate to complete ETC = (BAC − EV) ÷ CPI = (320 − 160) ÷ 0.70</td><td class="r">230</td></tr>
<tr><td>EAC<sub>f</sub> = AC + ETC = 230 + 230 &nbsp;(same as BAC ÷ CPI)</td><td class="r"><b>460</b></td></tr>
