<div class="final"><p class="ct">Reading the result</p><p>At period 7 the project is <b>behind schedule</b> (SV = −40, SPI = 0.80) and <b>over budget</b> (CV = −70, CPI = 0.70), with 50% of the budget earned. If the current efficiency continues, the project will cost about <b>$460k</b> instead of $320k (a VAC of −140k) and finish in about 13.8 periods. TCPI is 1.78, meaning the remaining work would need to earn $1.78 of value per remaining dollar of budget, which is unrealistic, so scope reduction or accepting the overrun is the only realistic choice.</p></div>

