<section id="ch13-exam" class="section-block">
<h3>What is in the exam scope</h3>
<aside class="callout exam"><p class="ct">Numericals from this chapter</p><p>The syllabus marks <b>Chapter 13 (N)</b>. Your formula sheet lists EV, CV, SV, SPI, CPI, TCPI, EAC, ETC, TEAC, PCIB and PCIC. The numerical material is your professor's <b>Digital Camera Prototype</b> example, the monthly status report and the TCPI example from his slides, the book's <b>Exercises 1 to 8</b> (including Aurora Parts A and B), and the <b>Scanner Project</b> case data. Chapter review questions, discussion questions and the narrative parts of the cases are theory.</p></aside>
