<aside class="callout exam"><p class="ct">How to write the assessment</p><ul><li>State both signs: "behind schedule (SV −X, SPI 0.9) and over budget (CV −Y, CPI 0.8)".</li><li>Say how much of the budget is earned (PCIB).</li><li>Forecast: "if the current efficiency continues, EAC = ..., an overrun of ...".</li><li>Comment on the trend and recommend an action.</li></ul></aside>
